deps/alice/shapes: v1.0.0, src/area, src/geometry.
deps/bob/units: v1.2.0, src/meters.
deps/erin/tools: v1.0.0, src/tool.
nothing to do: 0
== what fails leaves deps/ and cesia.lock as they were
dan/plain has no cesia.toml at v1.0.0: it is not a Cesia project.
carol/ring has no package "nope": it has a, b.
Can't fetch carol/ring at v9.9.9: fatal: Remote branch v9.9.9 not found in upstream origin
== what could leave deps/ or give git an option is refused before git runs
"github.com/alice/../../../outside" is no repository cesia pkg takes: the folders of its place under deps/ are letters, digits and . _ - @, never first a . or a -.
"--upload-pack=touch TOP/ran;://x/y" is no repository cesia pkg takes: the folders of its place under deps/ are letters, digits and . _ - @, never first a . or a -.
"--help" is no tag cesia pkg takes: letters, digits and . _ - +, never first a . or a -.
nothing ran, nothing written outside
lock unchanged
deps
deps/alice
deps/alice/shapes
deps/bob
deps/bob/units
deps/erin
deps/erin/tools
== a ring of uses ends
deps/carol/ring: v1.0.0, src/a, src/b.
== a moved tag
alice/shapes moved its tag v1.0.0: cesia.lock says HASH, and it is HASH now. If that is right: cesia pkg update shapes --to v1.0.0.
lock unchanged
no deps/, as before
deps/alice/shapes: v1.0.0, src/area, src/geometry.
deps/bob/units: v1.2.0, src/meters.
deps/carol/ring: v1.0.0, src/a, src/b.
deps/erin/tools: v1.0.0, src/tool.
== update to the newest tag
shapes: v1.0.0 to v1.1.0
version = "v1.1.0"
version = "v1.0.0"
version = "v1.0.0"
a square of v1.1.0, 9 meters of units v1.2.0
== move to a fork
deps/frank/shapes: v1.1.0, src/area, src/geometry.
deps/alice/shapes: removed.
src/main.ce: use deps/frank/shapes/
from = "file://TOP/repos/frank/shapes"
from = "file://TOP/repos/erin/tools"
from = "file://TOP/repos/carol/ring"
use deps/frank/shapes/geometry
Print(geometry.Describe())
